					"content": "我们这是被赶出来了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410702,
					"content": "现在怎么办？真的让影和将军在里面一直打下去吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410703,
					"content": "虽然她说得头头是道，只有这样才能修改将军的运行法则，可是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410704,
						120410705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410704,
					"content": "影已没有肉身，必须靠将军。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410706
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120410706,
					"content": "对吧？而且影很顽固，容易走进死胡同…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410707,
					"content": "要是太执着于胜负忘记了初衷，说不定…就再也出不来了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410708,
						120410709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410708,
					"content": "现在离开还太早了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120410710,
					"content": "嗯！我们应该像之前一样，帮她一把，让她更快地突破这场考验。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410711,
					"content": "有没有办法缩短她在里面的时间，或者直接帮她获得胜利？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410712,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410713
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120410713,
					"content": "再怎么说也不能让影在里面出什么意外吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410714,
					"content": "可是，这个地方不让我们进去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120410715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120410715,
					"content": "想要帮她，怎么都要先进去才行。怎么办，怎么办，要不要撞一下试试…",
